      "options": {
       "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Expert buyer representation in Northern Colorado. Get professional guidance, negotiation support, and access to exclusive listings. Find your dream home today!\"><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Buyer Representation, Northern Colorado Homes, Home Buying Process, Real Estate Agent, Fort Collins, Loveland, Greeley, Windsor, Eaton, Berthoud\"><meta name=\"author\" content=\"The Little Lady Sells Homes\">\r\n<link href=\"styles.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\r\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n        }\r\n        header, footer {\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n            background-color: #8B0000; /* Updated to brand color */\r\n            color: white;\r\n            padding: 15px 10px;\r\n        }\r\n        section {\r\n            padding: 20px;\r\n            max-width: 800px;\r\n            margin: 0 auto;\r\n            background: white;\r\n            border-radius: 8px;\r\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\r\n        }\r\n        h1, h2 {\r\n            color: #8B0000; /* Updated to brand color */\r\n        }\r\n        ul, ol {\r\n            padding-left: 20px;\r\n        }\r\n        form {\r\n            display: flex;\r\n            flex-direction: column;\r\n            gap: 10px;\r\n        }\r\n        label {\r\n            font-weight: bold;\r\n        }\r\n        input, textarea {\r\n            width: 100%;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            border: 1px solid #ccc;\r\n            border-radius: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        button {\r\n            background-color: #8B0000; /* Updated to brand color */\r\n            color: white;\r\n            border: none;\r\n            padding: 10px;\r\n            cursor: pointer;\r\n            border-radius: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        button:hover {\r\n            background-color: #a52a2a; /* Slight variation for hover effect */\r\n        }\r\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n            section {\r\n                padding: 15px;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n</style>\r\n<header>\r\n<h1><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">Buyer&rsquo;s Representation</span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Your trusted guide to purchasing a home in Northern Colorado.</p>\r\n</header>\r\n\r\n<section id=\"why-choose\">\r\n<h2>Why Choose Buyer Representation?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>As your buyer&rsquo;s agent, I work exclusively for you, ensuring your best interests are protected throughout the home-buying process.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Expert negotiation to get you the best deal</li>\r\n\t<li>Comprehensive market analysis for informed decisions</li>\r\n\t<li>Assistance with contracts and paperwork</li>\r\n\t<li>Guidance from home search to closing</li>\r\n\t<li>Access to exclusive listings and new home developments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section id=\"process\">\r\n<h2>Our Home Buying Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Here&rsquo;s what you can expect when working with me:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li><strong>Initial Consultation:</strong> Understanding your needs and preferences.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Home Search:</strong> Finding properties that match your criteria.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Viewing &amp; Evaluation:</strong> Touring homes and assessing value.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Making an Offer:</strong> Negotiating terms in your favor.</li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Closing:</strong> Ensuring a smooth transaction and handing over the keys.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<section id=\"contact\">\r\n<form action=\"/submit-form\" method=\"post\"><button type=\"submit\">Send Message</button></form>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<footer>\r\n<p>&copy; 2025 The Little Lady Sells Homes | Northern Colorado Real Estate</p>\r\n</footer></head></html>\n"
